    "5-10 minute sessions work best. End on a win and your pup will be eager for next time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5-10 minuten sessies werken het best. Eindig met een succes en je pup zal enthousiast zijn voor de volgende keer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "6-18 months": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6-18 maanden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7 days free": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7 dagen gratis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8-12 Weeks: Foundation Phase": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8-12 weken: Fundamentfase"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "8-14 Weeks: Getting Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "8-14 weken: Aan de slag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "9-point scale": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "9-puntsschaal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Quick Test": {
      "comment": "Title of a quiz in the Welcome module of the Foundations extension.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een snelle test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bombproof recall that could save your dog's life. Here's the secret: don't use their name or 'come' — those words are worn out from daily overuse ('Come here!', 'Max, come!', 'Come on, let's go!'). Instead, you'll choose a 'magic word' that you ONLY use for emergency recall, paired with a high-value treat that makes coming to you irresistible.": {
      "comment": "Description of the \"Magic Word Recall\" skill.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een kogelvrije terugroep die het leven van je hond kan redden. Dit is het geheim: gebruik niet hun naam of 'kom' — die woorden zijn versleten door dagelijks overgebruik ('Kom hier!', 'Max, kom!', 'Kom op, laten we gaan!'). In plaats daarvan kies je een 'toverwoord' dat je ALLEEN gebruikt voor noodterugroep, gecombineerd met een hoogwaardige beloning die naar jou komen onweerstaanbaar maakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clicker": {
      "comment": "Name of a training tool used in the Training.Foundations.Welcome section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een clicker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A consistent sound that marks the exact moment of success. You can use a word instead, but avoid \"yes!\" — you say it often in daily life, which dilutes its meaning. A clicker is clear and unmistakable.": {
      "comment": "Description of the \"A clicker\" training tool.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een consistent geluid dat het exacte moment van succes markeert. Je kunt ook een woord gebruiken, maar vermijd \"ja!\" — je zegt het vaak in het dagelijks leven, wat de betekenis verwatert. Een clicker is helder en onmiskenbaar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dog who lies down perfectly on carpet may refuse on wet grass because it feels strange. A dog who sits instantly at home may act confused in a busy park.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of why dogs may forget tasks in different environments.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een hond die perfect gaat liggen op tapijt kan weigeren op nat gras omdat het vreemd aanvoelt. Een hond die thuis meteen gaat zitten kan verward lijken in een druk park."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few indoor moments lately. Would you like to reactivate potty training guidance?": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een paar binnenmomentjes laatst. Wil je de zindelijkheidsbegeleiding weer activeren?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A hungry puppy is a motivated puppy. Schedule training sessions before meal times.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een hongerige puppy is een gemotiveerde puppy. Plan trainingssessies vóór maaltijden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A note": {
      "comment": "Note displayed in the \"Welcome\" page of the Foundations module.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een notitie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A professional trainer can help if this continues": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een professionele trainer kan helpen als dit aanhoudt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick check-in helps us focus advice on what matters most.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een snelle check-in helpt ons advies te focussen op wat het belangrijkst is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet space": {
      "comment": "Placeholder text for a UI element that allows the user to select a quiet space for training.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een rustige plek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rate over 30 bpm at rest may indicate distress. Contact your vet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een frequentie boven 30 per minuut in rust kan stress aangeven. Neem contact op met je dierenarts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A recall affects %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een terugroepactie betreft %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A simple flat collar and a 2m fixed-length leash. No retractables.": {
      "comment": "Description of a collar and leash that is suitable for training.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een simpele platte halsband en een 2m vaste lijn. Geen rollijnen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A simple skill to get your puppy's attention. Note: your puppy's name gets used constantly in daily life ('Good dog, Max!', 'No, Max!', 'Max, stop that!'), so it becomes background noise over time. That's perfectly fine — the name is for casual attention, not emergencies. For reliable recall, you'll use a special 'magic word' later.": {
      "comment": "Description of a training skill, focusing on its purpose and how it can be practiced.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een eenvoudige vaardigheid om de aandacht van je puppy te krijgen. Let op: de naam van je puppy wordt constant gebruikt in het dagelijks leven ('Brave hond, Max!', 'Nee, Max!', 'Max, stop daarmee!'), dus het wordt na verloop van tijd achtergrondruis. Dat is prima — de naam is voor informele aandacht, niet voor noodgevallen. Voor betrouwbare terugroep gebruik je later een speciaal 'toverwoord'."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single log starts your timeline and unlocks smarter suggestions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eén log start je tijdlijn en ontgrendelt slimmere suggesties."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sit that happens with a flick of your hand. A recall that cuts through any distraction. A dog who looks to you for guidance, trusts your cues, and wants to get it right.": {
      "comment": "Paragraph describing the benefits of training a dog.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een zit die gebeurt met een handgebaar. Een terugroep die door elke afleiding heen snijdt. Een hond die naar jou kijkt voor begeleiding, je signalen vertrouwt en het goed wil doen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A special moment with %@ - %@": {
      "comment": "A caption for a photo moment shared on Instagram. The argument is the name of the person in the photo, and the second argument is the date of the photo.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "A special moment with %1$@ - %2$@"
