    "After 10-20 repetitions, say 'sit' and wait 2 seconds before helping with the gesture. Give them a chance to respond to the word alone.": {
      "comment": "How-to step for the \"Sit\" skill, focusing on waiting for the puppy to respond to the word \"sit\" before assisting with the gesture.",
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na 10-20 herhalingen, zeg 'zit' en wacht 2 seconden voordat je helpt met het gebaar. Geef ze de kans om alleen op het woord te reageren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After accident — go outside now!": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
