    "After each click and treat, restart from step 1: walk 2-3 steps with hand low on nose, then bring it up high again. Sometimes reward at step 1, sometimes skip to the high position.": {
      "comment": "How-to step for Training.Skills.LooseLeashWalking, focusing on the sequence of actions to be repeated.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na elke klik en beloning, begin opnieuw vanaf stap 1: loop 2-3 stappen met je hand laag op de neus, breng hem dan weer hoog. Soms beloon je bij stap 1, soms sla je over naar de hoge positie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
