    "Between 6-18 months, dogs commonly \"forget\" things they knew as puppies. This is biology, not failure! Stay patient and consistent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tussen 6-18 maanden \"vergeten\" honden vaak dingen die ze als puppy wisten. Dit is biologie, geen falen! Blijf geduldig en consequent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Between 6-18 months, your dog will likely \"forget\" things they knew perfectly as a puppy.": {
      "comment": "Warning about the adolescent regression period for dogs.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tussen 6-18 maanden zal je hond waarschijnlijk dingen \"vergeten\" die ze als puppy perfect kenden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Between sessions, watch for natural sits. Mark and reward immediately. This reinforces the behavior throughout the day.": {
      "comment": "How-to step for reinforcing the 'sit' behavior by rewarding the puppy when it sits naturally during training sessions.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tussen sessies door, let op natuurlijke zits. Markeer en beloon direct. Dit versterkt het gedrag de hele dag door."
          }
        }
      }
    },
