          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouw duur zeer langzaam op"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build duration, distance, and handle distractions": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouw duur, afstand op en ga om met afleidingen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build duration, distance, and work through distractions": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouw duur, afstand op en werk door afleidingen heen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build duration: after the down, move your hand down to ankle quickly, then back up. Your puppy thinks the hand is still near and stays put. Return route = same as exit route (sneak hand down behind legs).": {
      "comment": "How-to step for the 'down' skill: after the down, move the hand down quickly to the ankle, then back up. This helps your puppy understand that the hand is still near and they should stay",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duur opbouwen: na het af, beweeg je hand snel naar je enkel, dan weer omhoog. Je puppy denkt dat de hand nog dichtbij is en blijft liggen. Terugweg = zelfde als heenweg (sluip hand achter benen naar beneden)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build good habits": {
      "comment": "Title for a feature discovery tip related to training skills.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouw goede gewoontes op"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build height gradually: ankle → knee → hip → waist. At each level, your puppy must think 'that gesture means go down.' Be patient at each transition.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouw hoogte geleidelijk op: enkel → knie → heup → taille. Op elk niveau moet je puppy denken 'dat gebaar betekent af.' Wees geduldig bij elke overgang."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build the Association": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
