            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voorbeeldcommando's:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: \"Sit\" — treat on nose, move up and back, dog sits. Click. Treat.": {
      "comment": "Example of a classical training exercise.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voorbeeld: \"Zit\" — snoepje bij neus, beweeg omhoog en terug, hond zit. Klik. Snoepje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example: \"Watch Me\" — you wait silently until they glance at your face. Click. Treat.": {
      "comment": "Example of using the \"Watch Me\" technique in \"How Dogs Learn\" module.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voorbeeld: \"Kijk me aan\" — je wacht stil tot ze naar je gezicht kijken. Klik. Snoepje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Examples of good magic words: 'Bingo!', 'Yippee!', 'Presto!', 'Party!', 'Jackpot!', 'Happy!' (great for non-native English speakers)": {
      "comment": "Tips for choosing a magic word, including examples.",
