    "Food bowl training: put a few kibbles in the bowl, lower it toward the ground. If puppy dives → pull the bowl up. Wait 20 seconds.": {
      "comment": "How-to step for training a puppy to wait at a food bowl.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voerbaktraining: doe een paar brokjes in de bak, laat hem naar de grond zakken. Als puppy duikt → trek de bak omhoog. Wacht 20 seconden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Food dispenser": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voerdispenser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For body handling: start when calm, gently touch ears, paws, tail, mouth while giving treats": {
      "comment": "Training module string for body handling technique.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor lichaamsverzorging: begin wanneer kalm, raak voorzichtig oren, poten, staart, bek aan terwijl je snoepjes geeft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For emergencies and reliable recall, you'll train a separate 'magic word' that stays powerful": {
      "comment": "Tip for the Training.Skills.NameRecognition section, explaining the importance of training a separate 'magic word' for emergencies and reliable recall.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor noodgevallen en betrouwbare terugroep train je een apart 'toverwoord' dat krachtig blijft"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For hyper dogs at mealtime: put them on leash. If they bark → time-out (20 seconds). Bring back, try again. Train during evening meals first.": {
      "comment": "Tip for training hyper dogs during mealtime.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voor hyper honden bij maaltijden: doe ze aan de lijn. Als ze blaffen → time-out (20 seconden). Breng terug, probeer opnieuw. Train eerst tijdens avondmaaltijden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For thousands of years, humans and dogs have evolved together — a partnership unlike any other in the animal kingdom. Dogs were bred not just to live alongside us, but to understand us, to read our gestures, to want to please us.": {
      "comment": "Paragraph 1 of the \"Welcome\" section in the \"Foundations\" module of the \"Training\" enum.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duizenden jaren lang zijn mensen en honden samen geëvolueerd — een partnerschap als geen ander in het dierenrijk. Honden zijn gefokt niet alleen om naast ons te leven, maar om ons te begrijpen, onze gebaren te lezen, ons te willen plezieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
