    "Give treats and praise immediately when your puppy goes outside. Make it a party!": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geef direct snoepjes en lof wanneer je puppy buiten gaat. Maak er een feestje van!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gives them a safe retreat when visitors come or when life gets overwhelming": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geeft ze een veilige toevlucht wanneer bezoekers komen of wanneer het leven overweldigend wordt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go back a step. Make it easier. Success builds confidence. Frustration kills learning.": {
      "comment": "Action to take when a dog is struggling with training.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ga een stap terug. Maak het makkelijker. Succes bouwt vertrouwen op. Frustratie doodt leren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go back to basics. Refresh skills from step 1.": {
      "comment": "Advice on what to do if a dog is in the adolescent regression stage.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ga terug naar de basis. Vernieuw vaardigheden vanaf stap 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go back to step 1 in the new environment. Lure them down. Click. Treat. Rebuild. It'll go faster this time — but you do need to rebuild.": {
      "comment": "Explanation of the training progression process in the \"Taking It Further\" module of the Foundations section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ga terug naar stap 1 in de nieuwe omgeving. Lok ze naar beneden. Klik. Snoepje. Herbouw. Het gaat sneller deze keer — maar je moet wel herbouwen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
