    "Gradually add duration and distance": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voeg geleidelijk duur en afstand toe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually expose your puppy to the full volume of the clicker over several sessions as they become comfortable.": {
      "comment": "Training tip for gradually exposing a clicker to full volume as a puppy becomes more comfortable.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stel je puppy geleidelijk bloot aan het volledige volume van de clicker over meerdere sessies naarmate ze comfortabeler worden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually increase distance. When reliable, progress to standing (but still with open arms and excitement). Eventually, you can be more casual, but always reward generously.": {
      "comment": "Training skill content - how to increase distance when using the 'Magic Recall' training method.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vergroot geleidelijk de afstand. Wanneer betrouwbaar, ga verder naar staan (maar nog steeds met open armen en enthousiasme). Uiteindelijk kun je meer casual zijn, maar beloon altijd royaal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually increase duration and pressure of handling - make it part of daily routine": {
      "comment": "How-to step for gradually increasing the duration and pressure of touch and handling exercises.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verhoog geleidelijk de duur en druk van het aanraken - maak het onderdeel van de dagelijkse routine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually increase duration. Once reliable, wait for 1 second of eye contact before clicking. Then 2. Then 3.": {
      "comment": "How to increase the duration of training sessions for the \"Watch Me\" skill.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verhoog geleidelijk de duur. Eenmaal betrouwbaar, wacht 1 seconde oogcontact voordat je klikt. Dan 2. Dan 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually increase steps between rewards": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verhoog geleidelijk stappen tussen beloningen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradually reduce supervision as reliability builds": {
      "localizations": {
