    "Long-duration stay that teaches independence. The 'Passive Stay' method: you give NO commands — the dog self-discovers that settling earns rewards.": {
      "comment": "Description of the 'Stay' skill, focusing on the 'Passive Stay' method.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langdurig blijven dat onafhankelijkheid leert. De 'Passief Blijf'-methode: je geeft GEEN commando's — de hond ontdekt zelf dat rustig liggen beloningen oplevert."
