    "More complex than sit. Trained with classical conditioning (luring), starting from a sit. Uses the tether technique to teach that lying down — not nose-pushing — earns the reward.": {
      "comment": "Description of the \"Down\" skill.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complexer dan zit. Getraind met klassieke conditionering (lokken), startend vanuit een zit. Gebruikt de tethertechniek om te leren dat liggen — niet met de neus duwen — de beloning oplevert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More event types": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
