    "Move slowly and smoothly": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beweeg langzaam en soepel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the treat slowly - your puppy's nose should follow": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beweeg de snack langzaam - de neus van je pup moet volgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the treat slowly and keep it close to their nose. Too fast or too high causes jumping and frustration": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beweeg de snack langzaam en houd deze dicht bij hun neus. Te snel of te hoog veroorzaakt springen en frustratie"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move your hand across your chest (right shoulder to left shoulder) then behind your back. This removes the hand from sight so your dog looks at your FACE instead.": {
      "comment": "How-to step for the \"Loose Leash Walking\" skill, focusing on moving the hand behind your back.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beweeg je hand over je borst (rechter schouder naar linker schouder) en dan achter je rug. Dit haalt de hand uit het zicht zodat je hond naar je GEZICHT kijkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving furniture": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meubels verplaatsen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving the lure too fast (puppy can't follow)": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het lokaas te snel bewegen (pup kan niet volgen)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving too fast - let them sniff sometimes": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te snel bewegen - laat ze soms snuffelen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving your hand forward (away from the dog) instead of straight down — they'll stand up to follow": {
      "comment": "Mistake to avoid when training a puppy to \"down\".",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hand naar voren bewegen (weg van de hond) in plaats van recht naar beneden — ze zullen opstaan om te volgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
