    "Train/bus station": {},
    "Trained purely with operant conditioning (passive). You do nothing except observe and click for eye contact. Because your puppy figures it out themselves, this creates deep, lasting learning.": {
      "comment": "Description of the \"Watch Me\" skill.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "Trained with classical conditioning (luring). No verbal commands during training — work only with hand signals. The hand signal is introduced immediately, becoming the cue from the start.": {
      "comment": "Description of the \"Sit\" skill, focusing on the training method used.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
