    "When he wakes, take him outside": {},
    "When one variable gets harder, the others should get easier. You're not testing your dog — you're setting them up for success. We'll show you exactly how this works when you start practicing!": {
      "comment": "Explanation of why changing one aspect of a training session can also affect the other aspects.",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als één variabele moeilijker wordt, moeten de andere makkelijker worden. Je test je hond niet — je zet ze op voor succes. We laten je precies zien hoe dit werkt als je begint met oefenen!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
