    "Work with hand signals, not words. Humans misuse words — we repeat, escalate, add pressure ('sit, sit, SIT!'). Hand signals can't be made 'louder' or more forceful. Add verbal cues only AFTER the behavior is reliable.": {
      "comment": "Tip for using hand signals over words in training.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
